flowchart LR
 Identity[Identity Events] --> SIEM[Security Telemetry Pipeline]
 API[API/App Events] --> SIEM
 AI[AI Security Events] --> SIEM
 Infra[Infrastructure/Runtime] --> SIEM
 Vuln[Vulnerability Findings] --> SIEM
 SIEM --> Detect[Detection Rules / Anomaly]
 Detect --> Alerts[Security Alerts]
 Alerts --> Triage[Triage]
 Triage --> Incident[Security Incident]
 Incident --> Contain[Contain / Revoke / Disable]
 Contain --> Recover[Recover / Restore / Rotate]
 Recover --> RCA[Root Cause / Corrective Actions]
 RCA --> Controls[Policy / Detection / SDLC Updates]
